; core.akl - Akalynth DSL Placeholder
;
; This file defines the foundational rules of the Akalynth world.
; The DSL parser is not yet implemented; this serves as a placeholder
; to anchor the rulebook hash and demonstrate structure.
;
; Future: This will specify movement rules, combat formulas, item behaviors,
; and other game mechanics in a declarative, auditable format.

; Rule: Server is authoritative
; Client sends intent only, never coordinates or truth claims.

; Rule: Every action emits a receipt
; All player actions are logged to an append-only audit trail.

; Rule: Movement is validated
; Speed limits, walkable tiles, and direction checks are enforced server-side.
